erent effects they apply to any enemy hit by the explosion. These are, in order of them spawning:"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Fire_Ducky","title":"Fire Ducky"},"children":["Fire Ducky"]}," inflicts a burn effect, which deals 5 damage every 0.5 tick during its 5 second burn time."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Confusion_Ducky","title":"Confusion Ducky"},"children":["Confusion Ducky"]}," induces confusion, causing affected enemies to reverse direction between 3 and 1 seconds, with the confusion time getting lower with enemy size. Affected enemies cannot be confused for the next 8 seconds."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ice_Ducky","title":"Ice Ducky"},"children":["Ice Ducky"]}," freezes any enemy hit by its explosion for 3 seconds."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Poison_Ducky","title":"Poison Ducky"},"children":["Poison Ducky"]}," applies poison to any enemy hit, dealing 20 damage every 0.5 tick and slowing them down by 15% for 3 seconds."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Shock_Ducky","title":"Shock Ducky"},"children":["Shock Ducky"]}," applies shock to any enemy caught by its explosion, stunning them for 3 seconds."]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwKQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Appearance"},"children":["Appearance"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Ducky Squad"]},"  consists of five ducks each wearing a differently colored hat for their respective element. "]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwLA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Strategy"},"children":["Strategy"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Ducky Squad"]}," can be very usef